">\\(\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8790486ac053461c\" href=\"?note=8790486ac053461c\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md\">../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-functor.md\">../batch18/58-df-functor.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}_{(-)}:V^3\\rightharpoonup V\">\\(\\operatorname{Hom}_{(-)}:V^3\\rightharpoonup V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a556f16d9432aae2\" href=\"?note=a556f16d9432aae2\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-hom.md\">../batch02/58-df-hom.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(-)^{\\mathrm{op}}:V\\rightharpoonup V\">\\((-)^{\\mathrm{op}}:V\\rightharpoonup V\\)</span> (opposite-category code)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}end} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCat2End}_S(E,F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,\\circ_C,e_C,D_0,D_1,s_D,t_D,\\circ_D,e_D\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,\\circ_C,e_C\\rangle\\land\n\\mathcal D=\\langle D_0,D_1,s_D,t_D,\\circ_D,e_D\\rangle\\land\n\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal D)\\land\n\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}}\\times\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\land\nE\\in D_0\\land\n\\exists\\pi\\;\\Bigl[\n\\pi:C_0\\to V\\land\n\\forall c\\in C_0\\;\n\\bigl(\\pi_c\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(E,F(c,c))\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall c,c&#39;\\in C_0\\;\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(c,c&#39;)\\;\n\\bigl(F(e_C(c),f)\\circ_D\\pi_c=F(f,e_C(c&#39;))\\circ_D\\pi_{c&#39;}\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall X\\in D_0\\;\\forall\\xi\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl[\n\\xi:C_0\\to V\\land\n\\forall c\\in C_0\\;\n\\bigl(\\xi_c\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(X,F(c,c))\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall c,c&#39;\\in C_0\\;\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(c,c&#39;)\\;\n\\bigl(F(e_C(c),f)\\circ_D\\xi_c=F(f,e_C(c&#39;))\\circ_D\\xi_{c&#39;}\\bigr)\n\\bigr]\\to\n\\exists!u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(X,E)\\;\n\\forall c\\in C_0\\;(\\xi_c=\\pi_c\\circ_D u)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}end} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCat2End}_S(E,F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,\\circ_C,e_C,D_0,D_1,s_D,t_D,\\circ_D,e_D\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,\\circ_C,e_C\\rangle\\land\n\\mathcal D=\\langle D_0,D_1,s_D,t_D,\\circ_D,e_D\\rangle\\land\n\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal D)\\land\n\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}}\\times\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\land\nE\\in D_0\\land\n\\exists\\pi\\;\\Bigl[\n\\pi:C_0\\to V\\land\n\\forall c\\in C_0\\;\n\\bigl(\\pi_c\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(E,F(c,c))\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall c,c&#39;\\in C_0\\;\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(c,c&#39;)\\;\n\\bigl(F(e_C(c),f)\\circ_D\\pi_c=F(f,e_C(c&#39;))\\circ_D\\pi_{c&#39;}\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall X\\in D_0\\;\\forall\\xi\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl[\n\\xi:C_0\\to V\\land\n\\forall c\\in C_0\\;\n\\bigl(\\xi_c\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(X,F(c,c))\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall c,c&#39;\\in C_0\\;\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(c,c&#39;)\\;\n\\bigl(F(e_C(c),f)\\circ_D\\xi_c=F(f,e_C(c&#39;))\\circ_D\\xi_{c&#39;}\\bigr)\n\\bigr]\\to\n\\exists!u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(X,E)\\;\n\\forall c\\in C_0\\;(\\xi_c=\\pi_c\\circ_D u)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This spells out the dinatural wedge and its universal property; the integral notation is only an abbreviation for this structure.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md","status":"resolved","id":"8790486ac053461c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-functor.md","status":"resolved","id":"877f1061e295cf5f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-hom.md","status":"resolved","id":"a556f16d9432aae2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-hom.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md","status":"resolved","id":"8790486ac053461c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-functor.md","status":"resolved","id":"877f1061e295cf5f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Functor}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-hom.md","status":"resolved","id":"a556f16d9432aae2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Hom}_{(-)}:V^3\\rightharpoonup V$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-hom.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"E,F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D,C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,\\circ_C,e_C,D_0,D_